     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I forgot to mention that the error can be resolved on Ubuntu machines by using <div><br></div><div>apt-get install <span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">libmpfr</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">dev</span></div><div><br></div><div>as suggested in <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/31311050/r-package-rmpfr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stackoverflow.com/questions/31311050/r-package-rmpfr&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363077813000&amp;usg=AOvVaw29brJ7XKZOv0cdWDS5VJ6w\">https://stackoverflow.com/questions/31311050/r-package-rmpfr</a></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>Am Samstag, 1. August 2015 14:22:49 UTC+2 schrieb Gregor de Cillia:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi there,<div><br></div><div>Recently I wanted to use the HH package for a shiny-markdown document. When I tried to deploy this document to <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363077813000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Aj-jymNRYbtfszAt0OieP\">shinyapps.io</a>, I encountered a problem that the HH package could not be built on the server. After some testing, I found out that the Rmpfr depency is the real problem. Here a minimal example (test.Rmd)</div><div><pre style=\"padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><span style=\"white-space:inherit;color:rgb(128,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><pre style=\"padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"white-space:inherit;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">---</span></code><span style=\"white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">-</span><br></pre></span><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">title</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;Untitled&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nruntime</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> shiny\r\noutput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> html_document\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">---</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">```</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nrequire</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> Rmpfr </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">```</span></code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">The document works just well locally on my windows 7 machine. However, trying to upload it using shinyapps::deployapp() leads to the following error</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;white-space:normal\"><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">configure</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> error</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> Header file mpfr.h not found</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> maybe use </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">--</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">with</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mpfr</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">include</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">INCLUDE_PATH\r\n</span></code></pre><pre style=\"padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color: