     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I forgot to mention that the error can be resolved on Ubuntu machines by using <div><br></div><div>apt-get install <span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">libmpfr</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">dev</span></div><div><br></div><div>as suggested in <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/31311050/r-package-rmpfr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stackoverflow.com/questions/31311050/r-package-rmpfr&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363077825000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3NtjqhrSRAwBQtdFPcjytI\">https://stackoverflow.com/questions/31311050/r-package-rmpfr</a><span><br><br>Am Samstag, 1. August 2015 14:22:49 UTC+2 schrieb Gregor de Cillia:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi there,<div><br></div><div>Recently I wanted to use the HH package for a shiny-markdown document. When I tried to deploy this document to <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363077825000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1zuQY6UZ7GfJYst61OvcDy\">shinyapps.io</a>, I encountered a problem that the HH package could not be built on the server. After some testing, I found out that the Rmpfr depency is the real problem. Here a minimal example (test.Rmd)</div><div><pre style=\"padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><span style=\"white-space:inherit;color:rgb(128,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><pre style=\"padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"white-space:inherit;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">---</span></code><span style=\"white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">-</span><br></pre></span><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">title</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;Untitled&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nruntime</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> shiny\r\noutput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> html_document\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">---</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">```</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">{</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">r</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nrequire</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> Rmpfr </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">```</span></code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">The document works just well locally on my windows 7 machine. However, trying to upload it using shinyapps::deployapp() leads to the following error</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;white-space:normal\"><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">configure</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> error</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> Header file mpfr.h not found</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> maybe use </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">--</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">with</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mpfr</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">include</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">INCLUDE_PATH\r\n</span></code></pre><pre style=\"padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><span style=\"white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ERROR</span><span style=\"white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> configuration failed </span><span style=\"white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,139)\">for</span><span style=\"white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> package ‘Rmpfr’</span><br></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">*</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> removing ‘</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">usr</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">local</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">lib</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">R</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">site</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">library</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Rmpfr’\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128)\">################################# End Task Log ################################# </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nError</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> Unhandled Exception</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> Child Task </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">61322212</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> failed</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> Error building image</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> Error building Rmpfr </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">0.5-7</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">. Build exited with non</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">zero status</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span></code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;white-space:normal\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">The full <span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">error log can be found in </span><a href=\"http://pastebin.com/D5KVc44n\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(12,101,165);font-size:15px;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://pastebin.com/D5KVc44n&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792363077825000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0RugqtrDmy7QLZUczQXbA8\">http://pastebin.com/D5KVc44n</a>. About one year ago, I already had a document with a similar setup (using the HH package) on KDE 14.04 and the deployment worked fine. Any suggestions are welcome.</span></div></span></code></pre></div></span></code></pre></pre></div></div></blockquote></span></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
